ed to load settings.":["Ayarlar y\u00fcklenemedi."],"Settings saved successfully.":["Ayarlar ba\u015far\u0131yla kaydedildi."],"Failed to save settings.":["Ayarlar kaydedilemedi."],"Exchange rates synced successfully.":["D\u00f6viz kurlar\u0131 ba\u015far\u0131yla senkronize edildi."],"Failed to sync exchange rates.":["D\u00f6viz kurlar\u0131 senkronize edilemedi."],"Loading settings\u2026":["Ayarlar y\u00fckleniyor\u2026"],"Manage Currencies":["Para Birimlerini Y\u00f6net"],"Display Options":["G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleme Se\u00e7enekleri"],"Advanced":["Geli\u015fmi\u015f"],"You have unsaved changes.":["Kaydedilmemi\u015f de\u011fi\u015fiklikleriniz var."],"Saving\u2026":["Kaydediliyor\u2026"],"Save Changes":["De\u011fi\u015fiklikleri Kaydet"],"Rounding":["Yuvarlama"],"Nearest":["En Yak\u0131na"],"Round up":["Yukar\u0131 Yuvarla"],"Round down":["A\u015fa\u011f\u0131 Yuvarla"],"Subtract":["\u00c7\u0131kar"],"Cache Compatibility":["\u00d6nbellek Uyumlulu\u011fu"],"Cache pages in the base currency":["Sayfalar\u0131 ana para biriminde \u00f6nbelle\u011fe al"],"Pages are cached in the store base currency and displayed prices are converted in the browser, so page caching plugins work without any configuration. Cart, checkout and order totals are always converted on the server. Turning this off makes the storefront convert prices on the server again, which caches badly. It does not restore the 1.0.0 behaviour exactly: the admin, REST API and scheduled-task fixes stay active either way.":["Sayfalar ma\u011fazan\u0131n ana para biriminde \u00f6nbelle\u011fe al\u0131n\u0131r ve g\u00f6r\u00fcnen fiyatlar taray\u0131c\u0131da d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcl\u00fcr; b\u00f6ylece sayfa \u00f6nbellekleme eklentileri hi\u00e7bir yap\u0131land\u0131rma gerektirmeden \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Sepet, \u00f6deme ve sipari\u015f toplamlar\u0131 her zaman sunucuda d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcl\u00fcr. Bunu kapatmak ma\u011faza vitrinini fiyatlar\u0131 yine sunucuda d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrmeye d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr, bu da k\u00f6t\u00fc \u00f6nbelleklenir. 1.0.0 davran\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 birebir geri getirmez: admin, REST API ve zamanlanm\u0131\u015f g\u00f6rev d\u00fczeltmeleri her iki durumda da etkin kal\u0131r."],"Enable %s":["%s para birimini etkinle\u015ftir"],"Rate type for %s":["%s i\u00e7in kur tipi"],"Exchange rate for %s":["%s i\u00e7in d\u00f6viz kuru"],"Fee type for %s":["%s i\u00e7in komisyon tipi"],"Fee amount for %s":["%s i\u00e7in komisyon tutar\u0131"],"Rounding mode for %s":["%s i\u00e7in yuvarlama modu"],"Rounding step for %s":["%s i\u00e7in yuvarlama ad\u0131m\u0131"]}}}